{
  "dom_id": "step-31403",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Computing a \"Greater Than\" Probability for a Uniformly Distributed Continuous Random Variable",
  "problem": "Given that the continuous random variable $Y$ is uniformly distributed on the interval $\\left[1, 16\\right],$ compute $P\\left(Y  \\geq  10\\right).$",
  "worked_solution": "The probability density function for a uniformly distributed continuous random variable $Y$ on an interval $[a,b]$ is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14128799/assets/64661e76a430c63a3ba74d43f3d074e43d5c03a1a09c39d714a087d5fb8b5afa.svg)\n\nOur random variable $Y$ is uniformly distributed on the interval $\\left[1, 16\\right],$ so it has the following probability density function:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/differential/14128799/assets/bd2bfc727ccdaeb4d0912640c12fa99900db52102aefe3a3dce46ad2e2cbfef0.svg)\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(Y\\ge 10) & =P(10\\le Y\\le 16) \\\\  & ={\\int }_{10}^{16}f(y)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{10}^{16}\\frac{1}{15}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & =\\frac{16-10}{15} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{15} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{5}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-31403\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"31403\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"8430\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-31403\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-8\">Computing a \"Greater Than\" Probability for a Uniformly Distributed Continuous Random Variable</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"31403\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n           